WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.736
Compare three artifacts by feasibility, value and consequence.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:06.538
An approved guide may be simple.

00:00:06.538 --> 00:00:12.609
A narrow estimate demonstration could show a useful AI role with human review.

00:00:12.609 --> 00:00:17.746
A complete live system demands permissions and integrations not established here.

00:00:17.746 --> 00:00:22.883
The best capstone is one we can actually finish and verify.
